---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog | Fabriant
description: Articles from Fabriant on Azure platform engineering, release reliability, security, cost and AI in production.
permalink: /blog/
---
      <section id="blog" class="page-top">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h1>Blog</h1>
          <p>Articles from our work on Azure platform engineering: releases, security, cost and AI in production.</p>
        </div>
        {%- if collections.posts and collections.posts.length %}
        <div class="post-list">
          {%- for post in collections.posts %}
          <a class="card card-link post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
            <p class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
            <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
            <p class="card-text">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            <span class="post-read">Read article →</span>
          </a>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        {%- else %}
        <div class="post-empty">
          <p>No articles yet. Check back soon.</p>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </section>
